# ─── ML Artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trained model binaries are excluded from git to avoid large binary blobs.
# Re-generate locally by running ml/rent_prediction/train.py and ml/suspicious_listing/train.py.
# See Memory.md "Decisions made during setup" for the rationale.
backend/ml/rent_prediction/artifacts/*.pkl
backend/ml/rent_prediction/artifacts/*.json
backend/ml/suspicious_listing/artifacts/*.pkl
backend/ml/suspicious_listing/artifacts/*.json

